Subject: [PATCH 14/22] Add configurable web image discovery for logo source
 candidates

---
 app/api/logo-source-search/route.ts | 15 ++++++
 cloudflare-env.d.ts                 |  1 +
 server/logo-source-search.mjs       | 78 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/logo-source-search.test.mjs   | 35 +++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 129 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 app/api/logo-source-search/route.ts
